    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūja ū kūlī Falao, ūkang'wīla gīkī, “Ū baba na a baana ba ng'wise bizaga ū kūfuma ī Kanaani, balī na a madaale gabo ga ng'holo na ng'ombe, pye nī shikolo shabo ī shingī; ī haha balī Gosheni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu walī na baana ba ng'wawe batanò abo akaja nabo ū kūlī Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūbabūja a baana ba ng'wawe benabo, “A bing'we, ū nīmo gwing'we ni nīmo kī?” Būnshokeja ū Falao gīkī, “A bise basese bako tūlī badīīmi, gīt'umo baalī bataale bise kūfuma kale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bongeja kūng'wīla, “Twizaga kūūnū kwikala ikanza, nguno ī nzala nhaale no ī Kanaani; jamalile gete a maswa ī mitugo ja basese bako. Tūlīkūlomba ūtūzunīlīje a bise basese bako twikale Gosheni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūng'wīla ū Yosefu, “Bebe angū ū so na a baana ba ng'wing'we bapeelelaga kūūnū kūlī bebe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na lūūlū nolelage ū so na a baana ba ng'wing'we a ha soga gete; nguno ī sī ya Misili yīyī īlī kū būtongi wako. Ūdūgije kūbatūūla nūūlū ī Gosheni; nīyo ūlū balīho bamò babo ūbamanile gīkī bagūdeebile chiza ū nīmo gwa kūdīīma, batūūlage nū būdīīmi wa mitugo jane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūntwala ū ise ū kūlī Falao; ū Yakobo ūmfuuha ū Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūmūja ū Yakobo gīkī, “Ūlī na būlamu bo myaka yīnga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yakobo ūnshokeja, “Ū būlamu bone ū mu shikū ja būshimīzi bone, būlī myaka igana na makūmi adatū. Ī myaka ya būlamu bone īlī migehu no, nīyo yokalile makoye; ītīko kūlenganīla nī ya būlamu bo bataale bane ū mu shikū ja būshimīzi wabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo aho wamala kūmfuuha ū Falao wīnga ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yosefu ūmpandīkīla ha kwikala ū ise na a baana ba ng'wawe ū mu sī ya Misili. Ūbalolela a ha soga gīt'umo Falao walī walagīīlīla; ūpandīkīla Lamesesi, ūbatīnīla sī ng'wenūmo ūbinha yūbiza sabo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūyūng'winha ī shilīwa ū ise na a baana ba ng'wawe, nī kaya ya ng'wa ise ī yose, kūlenganīla nū wingī wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilīwa mu shikū ja nzala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī sī yalī yamala gete ī shilīwa, nguno ī nzala yalī nhaale no. Ī sī ya Misili nī ya Kanaani jikayemba kīngī nasho kūlwa nzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūjikong'onha pyī ī hela ja mu Misili nī ja Kanaani kūlwa kūbajingīja shilīwa īsho bagūlaga; ī hela jenījo wajitwalaga kwikūlū lya ng'wa Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose būmala ī hela a bana Misili na a bana Kanaani; aho jashila, pyī ī Misili yiza ū kūlī Yosefu yūng'wīla gīkī, “Ī hela jise jashilile, alīyo twinahge ī shilīwa! Nibūlī tūnanuke ūlolile gīkī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yosefu ūbawīla, “Enhagi ī mitugo jing'we. Īkī ng'wamalile ī hela, ng'wenha ī mitugo ng'wayīnza, nang'winha ī shilīwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana bandya kūyūng'wenhela ū Yosefu ī mitugo jabo, bashika bayīnza wabinha ī shilīwa; būyūnekela falasa, ng'holo, mbūli, ng'ombe būyaga na nzobe. Ū ng'waka gwenūyo ūbabītya nguno ya kūyīnza mitugo jabo nang'hwe wabinha ī shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'waka aho gwakalīka, būnsanga hangī ū kū ng'waka ūyo gūkalondeela; biza balīng'wibūūlīla balīhaya, “Tūtīko kūmisa nūūlū hado ū sīswe ū nkūjiwa, ī gīkī ī hela jise jashilile fu, nī mitugo jise ī haha jabizile sabo yako; tūtī na sha kūng'winha nūūlū hado ū sīswe ū nkūjiwa, ūlū ītī mibīlī yise na malaale gise dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibūlī tūnanuke, na a malaale gise gakenaagūke alīyo nang'ho ūlolile? Tūgūlage, na a malaale gise ūgagūle, tūbize basese ba ng'wa Falao, pye na a malaale gise gabize gakwe. Gwike dūhū ū bebe ūtwinhe ī shilīwa a bise tūtizūshila akagaya na wa mbīyū, īkenaagūke ī sī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yossefu wīgūla pyī ī sī ya Misili, yūbiza ya ng'wa Falao; a bana Misili pye a bose ūmo bagelelile būgajinja a malaale gabo, nguno ī nzala yalī nhaale no, ī sī yūbiza ya ng'wa Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūbatūūla mu būsese a banhū pye a hose ū mu Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī sī ya bagabīji atīīgūlile, nguno a bene bapandīkīlaga ng'wa Falao ī shiigunaanīlo; ī shakūlya shabigelaga ū kūfuma ū mu shakwinhwa īsho bīnjaga kū ng'wa Falao. H'ī nguno yene batajingije a malaale gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūbawīla a banhū gīkī, “Ali lūūlū, ī lelo yenīyī īkī namugūla ng'wabiza ba ng'wa Falao pye na a malaale ging'we; jiiji ī mbīyū mulalīme muhambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ng'ūbbisha, managi gīkī īmò ya ng'witanò ya shose īsho mulīgesa mukūng'winha Falao. Īj'inè ja ng'witanò jene jing'we, ja kūhamba mu malaale, na kūlya mu kaya jing'we na baana bing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja balīhaya, “Ū bebe sīswe nkūjiwa wabūpījaga ū būpanga wise, bebe tūchīlage shigongo dūhū ūtwanukūle; a bise twabizaga basese ū kūlī Falao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yosefu ūgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo kūbiza shilagīlo ū mu sī ya Misili kūshisha lelo īlī; gīkī īmò ya ng'witanò ya matwajo ga mu sī īlī sabo ya ng'wa Falao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu kūng'wilahīlīla Ise Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
