          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isilaeli ūbiza wigasha Misili lūūlū, ipandī lya Gosheni. Ī kaya yakwe yūsaba no, hama būkwīla wangū, nguno baalī bibyaji kīngī nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo akikala ū mu Misili ikanza lya myaka ikūmi na mpungatī; ī myaka ya būlamu bokwe ū bose yalī igana makūmi anè na mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lya kūcha kwakwe ū Isilaeli aho lyegeela kūshika, akang'witana ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yosefu; ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ūlū ūlīzunya kūnīītīla mhayo, gūtūūlage ū nkono gwako ha sīlīlī y'itango lyane ūnilahīlīle, gīkī ūkūnīītīla yawiza mu ng'hana. Yaya ū kūnijīka mu Misili ū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū nūlaala, nīnjage ū mu sī ya Misili ūkanijīke hamò na a babyaji bane, ūko baajīkilwa a boi.” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Nakwīta ūmo ūlīhayīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla, “Nilahīlīlage.” Ū Yosefu ūng'wilahīlīla. Ū Isilaeli winama ha nsago gwa būlīīlī ūlamya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
